          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho-ke, ngenxa yokuthi umyalo wenkosi wawushubile futhi isithando somlilo sasishisa kakhulu, ilangabi lomlilo lawabulala lawo madoda athatha oShadiraki, uMeshaki no-Abhedinego.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
