            "sid": "DAN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khona-ke inkosi uNebukadinesari yamangala, yasukuma ngokushesha, yathi kubaphathi bayo: “Asiphonsanga yini amadoda amathathu eboshwe izandla emlilweni na? Baphendula, bathi enkosini: Kuyiqiniso, nkosi!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
