            "sid": "DAN 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNebukadinesari wasondela emnyango wesithando somlilo ovuthayo, wakhuluma wathi: “Shadiraki, noMeshaki, no-Abedi Nego, zinceku zikaNkulunkulu oPhezukonke, phumani nize lapha. Khona-ke uShadiraki, uMeshaki no-Abhedinego baphuma emlilweni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
