          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokho ngiyaleza ukuba bonke abantu, nezizwe, nezilimi, abakhuluma okubi ngoNkulunkulu kaShadiraki, noMeshaki, no-Abhedinego, banqunywe izicucu, izindlu zabo zenziwe iquba, ngokuba akakho omunye uNkulunkulu olandela lolu hlobo angahlenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
